# Build context of the Docker builds that copy the whole context: everything that .gitignore excludes (local state,
# caches, editors, local binaries) plus the repository metadata. ci/check-dockerignore.sh keeps this list in step with .gitignore.
.git
web
bin
dist
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/coverage.*
.cache
ci-out
reports
.dev
.e2e
.vercel
web/node_modules
web/coverage
internal/webui/dist
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
myriarchd
myrctl
myriarch-updater
myriarch-sim
**/CLAUDE.local.md
.claude
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
web/dist-mock
website/node_modules
website/public
website/resources
website/.hugo_build.lock
